          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 13072,
            "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"uk\">\n  <head><!-- ✨🧞‍♂️✨ 2 -->\n    <title>ML Optimization Engineer - Gonka Network Mining Operations в Syngrid – Djinni</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"x-ua-compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n  <meta name=\"ahrefs-site-verification\" content=\"e3fb4f761d8fc47e3989aa951de60e8790deb948c9050a096c02e8c189ed4d54\">\n  <meta name=\"google-translate-customization\" content=\"43b319e88d47400c-2c58b02d438c987e-gbc703ae24e1d942c-9\"/>\n\n    \n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"About Us:\nWe are a leading participant in the Gonka decentralized AI network (https://gonka.ai/), leveraging high-performance GPU infrastructure to maximize...\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://djinni.co/jobs/832679-ml-optimization-engineer-gonka-network-mining/\">\n  \n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n      {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \"@type\": \"JobPosting\", \"baseSalary\": {\"@type\": \"MonetaryAmount\", \"currency\": \"USD\", \"value\": {\"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\", \"maxValue\": 4000, \"minValue\": 2000, \"unitText\": \"MONTH\", \"validFrom\": \"2026-06-28T11:05:06.361886\", \"validThrough\": \"2026-07-28T11:05:06.361886\"}}, \"category\": \"ML AI\", \"datePosted\": \"2026-06-28T11:05:06.361886\", \"description\": \"About Us:\\nWe are a leading participant in the Gonka decentralized AI network (https://gonka.ai/), leveraging high-performance GPU infrastructure to maximize mining rewards. We\\u2019re seeking an ML Optimization Engineer to help us achieve superior efficiency and weight in the Gonka ecosystem.\\n \\nKey Responsibilities:\\nImplement advanced inference optimizations (speculative decoding, quantization, attention modifications, etc.) to maximize mining weight \\u2014 techniques already proven to achieve double weight with identical GPUs by other participants\\nFine-tune Docker configurations for various GPU models based on available registry\\nDevelop custom optimization strategies that balance throughput and quality\\nCreate and maintain custom Docker images optimized for specific GPU architectures\\nDesign and implement systems for stable and scalable mining of Gonka and other protocols\\nDevelop optimized images for Tenstorrent AI ASICs to expand our hardware ecosystem beyond current GPU deployment\\nMigrate Python code and VLLM implementations to new VLLM images and adapt them for specific GPU cards\\n \\nRequired Qualifications:\\nProven experience with large language model optimization techniques\\nStrong understanding of transformer architectures and attention mechanisms\\nProficiency with PyTorch, CUDA, and GPU optimization techniques\\nExperience with vLLM, FlashInfer, or similar inference optimization frameworks\\nFamiliarity with Docker containerization and GPU workload management\\n \\nPreferred Qualifications:\\nExperience with Claude Code Max (will be provided if needed)\\nPrevious experience with Gonka or similar decentralized AI networks\\nBackground in competitive ML or distributed systems optimization\\nExperience with NVIDIA GPU architectures (B200/B300/H200/H100/A100)\\nKnowledge of Tenstorrent AI ASICs or other specialized AI hardware\\n \\nWhat We Offer:\\nOpportunity to work with cutting-edge AI infrastructure\\nHigh performance-based bonuses tied to achieved weight improvements\\nPotential for full-time position with percentage of mining profits\\nFlexible remote work environment\\nAccess to high-end GPU hardware for experimentation\\n \\nApplication Process: Intrested candidates should submit their resume along with a brief description of their relevant experience in ML optimization or performance enhancement ideas.\\n\", \"directApply\": true, \"employmentType\": \"FULL_TIME\", \"experienceRequirements\": {\"@type\": \"OccupationalExperienceRequirements\", \"monthsOfExperience\": 24.0}, \"hiringOrganization\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Syngrid\", \"sameAs\": \"https://syngrid.net/\"}, \"identifier\": 832679, \"industry\": \"ml\", \"jobLocationType\": \"TELECOMMUTE\", \"title\": \"ML Optimization Engineer - Gonka Network Mining Operations\", \"url\": \"https://djinni.co/jobs/832679-ml-optimization-engineer-gonka-network-mining/\", \"validThrough\": \"2026-07-28T11:05:06.361886\"}\n    </script>\n  \n\n\n    \n  \n  \n    \n  \n\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"ML Optimization Engineer - Gonka Network Mining Operations в Syngrid \" />\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"About Us:<br>We are a leading participant in the Gonka decentralized AI network (https://gonka.ai/), leveraging high-performance GPU infrastructure to maximize mining rewards. We’re seeking an ML...\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://djinni.co/jobs/832679-ml-optimization-engineer-gonka-network-mining/\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://djinni.co/static/i/landing/jobs-push/social-preview/og_image_logo.png\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"About Us:<br>We are a leading participant in the Gonka decentralized AI network (https://gonka.ai/), leveraging high-performance GPU infrastructure to maximize mining rewards. We’re seeking an ML...\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"ML Optimization Engineer - Gonka Network Mining Operations в Syngrid \" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://djinni.co/static/i/landing/jobs-push/social-preview/og_image_logo.png\">\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"&nbsp;\"/>\n<meta name=\"msapplication-TileColor\" content=\"#4859FF\" />\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/static/manifest.json\" />\n<meta name=\"msapplication-square310x310logo\" content=\"/static/favicons/v03/mstile-310x310.png\" />\n<meta name=\"msapplication-square150x150lo