r/?ref=similar_jobs&amp;from=similar_jobs5&amp;similar_to=832679\" class=\"similar-card d-flex flex-column gap-1 text-reset text-decoration-none\">\n    \n  <header class=\"row gx-2 align-items-start\">\n    \n      <div class=\"col-auto\">\n        \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n<div\n  id=\"\"\n  class=\"userpic-wrapper userpic-color_0 userpic_sm_3  userpic-transparent is-company-logo userpic--logo\"\n  data-initials=\"I\"\n  style=\"--userpic-bg: var(--userpic-color-0)\"\n>\n  \n    <img\n      class=\"userpic-image userpic-image_img\"\n      src=\"https://p.djinni.co/94/8485656a9f5dff7be4b3a1d0ab9214/Vakansiyi_kvadrat_1__1__400.png\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n      alt=\"\"\n      onerror=\"this.classList.add('d-none')\"\n      itemprop=\"image\"\n    />\n  \n</div>\n\n      </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <h2 class=\"job-item__position fs-4 m-0 mb-1\">Prompt Spec Engineer</h2>\n      <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center column-gap-1\">\n        <span class=\"small text-gray-800 opacity-75 font-weight-500\">InProject</span>\n        <span class=\"d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center column-gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" title=\"Компанія має підтверджені найми\">\n    \n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#patch-check-fill\"></use></svg>\n\n  </span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-auto\">\n      <div class=\"fs-5\">\n        \n          <strong class=\"text-success text-nowrap small\"><span class=\"text-success text-nowrap\">\n  \n  \n\n  \n    до $2200\n  \n</span>\n  </strong>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n\n    \n      <div class=\"text-secondary\">\n        \n  \n  <div id=\"job-description-831728\">\n    \n      <p class=\"fs-5 mb-0\" \n        \n          style=\"\n          display: -webkit-box;\n          -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          -webkit-line-clamp: 2;\"\n        \n      >\n        Ми шукаємо Prompt Spec Engineer, який підсилить нашу команду розробки штучного інтелекту. Це роль не про &#34;творче спілкування з ChatGPT&#34;, а про глибоку...\n      </p>\n    \n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n    \n\n    <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2\">\n      \n        <span class=\"small font-weight-600\">\n          15 червня\n        </span>\n      \n      <span class=\"similar-card__btn ms-auto text-primary small font-weight-600\">\n        дивитись\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n\n        \n          <hr class=\"my-2 mx-1 text-gray-400\">\n          \n  \n  <a href=\"/jobs/824826-ai-engineer-image-video-generation/?ref=similar_jobs&amp;from=similar_jobs5&amp;similar_to=832679\" class=\"similar-card d-flex flex-column gap-1 text-reset text-decoration-none\">\n    \n  <header class=\"row gx-2 align-items-start\">\n    \n      <div class=\"col-auto\">\n        \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n<div\n  id=\"\"\n  class=\"userpic-wrapper userpic-color_0 userpic_sm_3  userpic-transparent is-company-logo userpic--logo\"\n  data-initials=\"Z\"\n  style=\"--userpic-bg: var(--userpic-color-0)\"\n>\n  \n    <img\n      class=\"userpic-image userpic-image_img\"\n      src=\"https://p.djinni.co/5c/01e31889b0a452f4ab306406608d2e/photo_2023-04-25_12.08.09_400.jpeg\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n      alt=\"\"\n      onerror=\"this.classList.add('d-none')\"\n      itemprop=\"image\"\n    />\n  \n</div>\n\n      </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <h2 class=\"job-item__position fs-4 m-0 mb-1\">AI Engineer (Image/ Video Generation)</h2>\n      <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center column-gap-1\">\n        <span class=\"small text-gray-800 opacity-75 font-weight-500\">Zeely</span>\n        <span class=\"d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center column-gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" title=\"Компанія має підтверджені найми\">\n    \n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#patch-check-fill\"></use></svg>\n\n  </span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-auto\">\n      <div class=\"fs-5\">\n        \n          \n  \n    <span class=\"text-body-tertiary fw-medium\"\n      data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" \n      title=\"Рівень зарплати відносно інших вакансій: $ — нижче середнього, $$ — середній, $$$ — вище середнього, $$$$ — найвищий\"\n    >$$</span>\n  \n\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n\n    \n      <div class=\"text-secondary\">\n        \n  \n  <div id=\"job-description-824826\">\n    \n      <p class=\"fs-5 mb-0\" \n        \n          style=\"\n          display: -webkit-box;\n          -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          -webkit-line-clamp: 2;\"\n        \n      >\n        Приєднуйся до нас як AI Engineer (Image &amp; Video Generation) та стань частиною команди, що будує та масштабує генеративні пайплайни для створення візуального...\n      </p>\n    \n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n    \n\n    <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2\">\n      \n        <span class=\"small font-weight-600\">\n          17 червня\n        </span>\n      \n      <span class=\"similar-card__btn ms-auto text-primary small font-weight-600\">\n        дивитись\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n\n        \n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 ms-3\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/jobs/?primary_keyword=ML+AI\">\n            Всі вакансії\n            ML AI\n            \n            &rarr;\n          </a>\n        \n        \n          <a href=\"/jobs/company-syngrid/\">\n            Всі вакансії\n            Syngrid\n            &rarr;\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  \n"
